    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "my son (4yo) woke up with a fever and these tiny little red/purple spots all over his legs and stomach. i tried pressing a clear glass against them to see if they go away but they dont seem to change color at all. is this just a normal heat rash or maybe something from a virus? he seems okay otherwise just a bit fussy.",
