    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay he's still pretty sleepy. if i give him the tylenol and he sleeps for a few hours, that should be fine right? i really think it's just a bug because his friends at school had something similar last week. as long as i keep an eye on him at home, i don't need to rush to the hospital, do i?",
